Dear Sir / Madam,

We make memorial and sympathy gifts for pet owners and also a small spring range. Please find our offer below, photos attached.

ITEM 1 - TKK3Z3CTC Memorial Pet Travel Cup, ceramic Perfect Cup, "CATS", 17 oz, gift box
- Price: USD 4.55 per pc, FOB Shenzhen
- MOQ: 800 pcs
- Lead time: 35 days production + 35 days sea freight
- Size 3.55 x 5.24 x 7 in, weight 1.21 lb
- Materials: stoneware body, PP lid with silicone seal
- Care: dishwasher safe, top rack
- Artwork by freelance illustrator Necy Yu. Please note the artwork licence covers resale in the United States only. We can ask the artist to extend it.
- Colour: multicolour. Made in China.
- Custom text on the cup is possible, USD 0.40 per pc extra for each new text.

ITEM 2 - CODVB3JAV Hop Into Spring "Floral Bunny" coffee cup, Cup O' Java style, 17 oz
- Price: USD 2.70 per pc, FOB Shenzhen
- MOQ: 300 pcs
- Ceramic (stoneware), size 4.5 x 5.7 x 4.25 in, weight 0.5 lb
- Dishwasher safe, top rack
- Design by EveArt, multicolour, made in China

Sample charge USD 12 per piece.

Kind regards,
Daniel Wu
Remembrance Keepsakes Ltd. | Shenzhen

